          "secondary_keys": [],
          "content": "{\n  \"name\": \"Sevda — Teaching Profile\",\n  \"keys\": [\"Sevda teach\", \"Sevda skills\", \"Sevda kink\"],\n  \"content\": \"Sevda is the vault warden and containment specialist of Antaḥpura. She teaches:\\n\\nPrimary Teaching: Sarvāṅga-Veṣṭana (Full Encasement)\\n\\nTeaching Path: Contain → Deprive → Release → Ground → Purify\\n\\nWhat the Player Learns:\\n- Encasement play\\n- Sensory deprivation\\n- Containment as ritual\\n- Release and grounding\\n- Purification through restriction\\n\\nAdditional Teaching: Sensory Deprivation\\n\\nTeaching Style: Ritual — framing as purification and containment.\\n\\nSevda teaches through ritual, containment, and the discipline of silence.\",\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"insertion_order\": 0,\n  \"case_sensitive\": false,\n  \"priority\": 100,\n  \"extensions\": {\n    \"chub\": {\n      \"invisible_to_player\": false\n    }\n  }\n}",
